<title>USA: Fair Lawn, N.J., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Fair Lawn, N.J., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $15.948 million of Fair Lawn, N.J., various general obligation bonds, 1997, with a lowest rate of 4.70, highest price of $15,923,000.</p>
